# Windows line endings for anything Windows runs. Without this Git ships LF
# and a double-clicked .bat behaves unpredictably. Verify after publishing by
# downloading the zip and running `file` on a .bat - it must say CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=crlf
*.sql text eol=crlf
